# Striped flatweave rug (issue 166): denim and cream stripes along its long side, a denim border, cream fringe at the short ends and a faint weave texture. Seen from above (flat, like a floor), ink outline, no print. 4x2 tiles. Lies on the floor under the player.
size: 64x32
